 Redis in Short:
"Redis is your app's SUPER-FAST temporary memory" ⚡

Stores data in RAM (lightning fast)

Perfect for temporary stuff: sessions, cache, real-time data

Auto-expires data (no cleanup needed)

Like a quick notepad vs a permanent file cabinet

🎯 RabbitMQ in Short:
"RabbitMQ is your app's BACKGROUND WORKER MANAGER" 🚀

Handles tasks behind the scenes without making users wait

Distributes work among multiple workers

Keeps tasks safe in queue until processed

Like having a team of assistants - you give them work and focus on more important things

